                {
                  "id": "s3-body",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Count on Stoops’ On-Site Mobile Trailer Service to get you back on the road. Whether for emergency breakdowns, roadside repair, preventive maintenance, DOT inspections, or scheduled onsite repairs, our Mobile Service Truck is ready and at your service!\n\nPreventative Maintenance\n\nFHWA inspections, repair DOT (Violations), etc.\n\nBrakes\n\nReplace brake shoes/drums, adjust brakes, replace wheel seals\n\nElectrical\n\nRepair/replace lights/wiring, ABS diagnostics, troubleshooting\n\nBody Work\n\nRoof/panel patches, repair/replace swing and roll-up doors, repair/replace landing gear\n\nSuspension\n\nSlider pins, airbags, brake chambers, air valves, shocks",
                    "width": "full"
                  },
                  "styles": {
                    "base": {
                      "textColor": "#ffffff@85%"
                    }
                  }
